by loop0015 item 01 (2026-11-05).","+% Independent replay -- drafted by loop0015 item 01 (2026-11-05), rewritten in","+% plain English by item 08x (2026-11-05)."," % Every number here is read from paper3/replay/logs/ (regenerate: re-run"," % ~/dev/untrusted/replay/run_sandbox.sh as paper3/replay/README.md records;"," % the counts below come from `grep -c` on the copied logs, see"]},{"oldStart":6,"oldLines":69,"newStart":7,"newLines":75,"lines":[" \\section{Independent replay}"," \\label{sec:replay}"," ","-The repository holds no recorded \\texttt{\\#print axioms} output for the","-family, no continuous integration that builds its Lean, and","-\\texttt{enable\\_nanoda: false} in the comparator's JSON","-(Section~\\ref{sec:proof}). We therefore built the solution's import","-closure ourselves, in isolation, at the toolchain the repository pins, and","-recorded what the kernel reports. This section says exactly what was run,","-where, and what came out; the scripts are quoted verbatim in","+The repository holds no saved output of the axiom check for the family,","+no automated build of its Lean, and \\texttt{enable\\_nanoda: false} in the","+comparator's settings (Section~\\ref{sec:proof}). We therefore built the","+proof ourselves, in isolation, at the Lean version the repository pins,","+and recorded what the kernel reports. This section says exactly what was","+run, where, and what came out. The scripts are quoted verbatim in"," \\repofile{paper3/replay/README.md}, and the logs are under"," \\repofile{paper3/replay/logs/}."," "," \\subsection{What was run, and where}"," "," A fresh copy of the clone (commit \\texttt{4eaee875}) was built inside a","-\\texttt{bwrap} (bubblewrap) sandbox on the project's machine: the system","-directories bound read-only, a private \\texttt{tmpfs} home with nothing of","-the real home or of this repository visible, separate PID, IPC and UTS","-namespaces, the whole sandbox confined to eight cores","-(\\texttt{taskset -c 0-7}) at the lo